# packwiz hashes files byte-for-byte. Git's autocrlf was rewriting line
# endings between the working copy (CRLF on Windows) and the repo (LF),
# so index.toml recorded CRLF hashes while players downloaded LF content --
# every affected file failed with "Invalid mod file hash".
# Store everything exactly as it is on disk. Do not remove this.
* -text
